WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:37,290
Come on, it's your turn. The last giant has indeed exploded.

2
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:47,440
What if he is a road killer? He will blow himself up and die with us.

3
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:51,020
He's not he's just an ordinary great man believe me

4
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:52,820
But how do you know him?

5
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:57,430
I know he is a great man because I am a prophet

6
00:00:57,690 --> 00:01:06,700
I knew you were a cunning prophet.

7
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:09,620
Guess what

8
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:11,160
I found it again

9
00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:42,100
You're right. There's nothing to say. I'm a prophet.

10
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:43,900
kill me now

11
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:46,680
Then you go die

12
00:01:46,940 --> 00:01:47,960
prophet

13
00:01:48,220 --> 00:01:49,240
The prophet is gone

14
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:57,080
Isn't it good for him to hide?

15
00:01:57,340 --> 00:02:02,260
How could he possibly deceive this great man?

16
00:02:02,520 --> 00:02:04,060
Okay, everyone, look over here

17
00:02:04,320 --> 00:02:07,900
Now the final answer to the mystery is revealed. What is the answer to the mystery?

18
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:11,250
Roadkiller's Death Together has now been used up.

19
00:02:11,510 --> 00:02:12,530
I want to go too

20
00:02:12,730 --> 00:02:17,350
Stop pretending. I am the only prophet in the audience. That’s right.

21
00:02:17,610 --> 00:02:19,650
I found out all the great people

22
00:02:19,910 --> 00:02:22,970
I asked Lin Yang to pretend to be a prophet to block the fatal blow for me

23
00:02:23,230 --> 00:02:27,070
These two stupid great men really believed in the fat man

24
00:02:27,330 --> 00:02:28,610
you are a prophet

25
00:02:30,750 --> 00:02:35,330
If he hadn't tricked the road killer, I might have died, you idiot.

26
00:02:35,590 --> 00:02:37,630
You don't want to think about anything but the prophet

27
00:02:37,890 --> 00:02:40,710
Who can survive from that monster's belly? That's it.

28
00:02:40,970 --> 00:02:42,490
You stupid

29
00:02:43,210 --> 00:02:44,370
So that's it

30
00:02:44,740 --> 00:02:46,660
Brother Lin Yang is righteous

31
00:02:47,440 --> 00:02:48,980
We will torture him to death today

32
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,760
Revenge for Brother Lin Yang

33
00:02:51,020 --> 00:02:57,780
I knew I was crazy about this great man

34
00:02:58,040 --> 00:03:00,360
Didn’t you die together with Lin Yang?
